00:03:52,941 --> 00:03:58,941
40 stories of sheer adventure!

2
00:07:45,882 --> 00:07:51,882
Die Hard is a action, thriller film directed by John McTiernan.

3
00:11:38,823 --> 00:11:44,823
NYPD cop John McClane's plan to reconcile with his estranged wife is thrown for a serious loop when, minutes after he
arrives at her office's Christmas Party, the entire building is overtaken by a group of terrorists.

4
00:15:31,764 --> 00:15:37,764
With little help from the LAPD, wisecracking McClane sets out to
single-handedly rescue the hostages and bring the bad guys down.

5
00:19:24,705 --> 00:19:30,705
John McClane, played by Bruce Willis.

6
00:23:17,647 --> 00:23:23,647
Hans Gruber, played by Alan Rickman.

7
